# Frontend Conventions

## Stack
- **Jinja2** — server-side HTML templating
- **HTMX** — dynamic updates without JavaScript frameworks
- **Plain CSS** — no Tailwind, no Bootstrap, no CSS-in-JS

## No JavaScript Frameworks
Do not introduce React, Vue, Alpine.js, or any JS framework.
HTMX handles all dynamic behavior.

## Template Structure
```
app/templates/
  base.html            # Base layout: nav, CSS links, HTMX script tag
  index.html           # Main page: calendar + chat layout
  partials/            # Standalone HTML fragments returned by HTMX requests
    calendar.html
    workout_card.html
    chat_message.html
```

All templates extend `base.html`. Partials are standalone fragments — no `<html>` or `<body>` tags.

## CSS
All styles live in `app/static/css/main.css`. Use CSS custom properties for theming:

```css
:root {
  --color-primary: #e05c1a;   /* cycling orange */
  --color-bg: #f9f9f9;
  --color-text: #1a1a1a;
  --color-border: #ddd;
  --spacing-sm: 8px;
  --spacing-md: 16px;
  --spacing-lg: 32px;
}
```

## HTMX
Load from CDN in `base.html`. Always pin to a specific version — do not use `@latest`.
